1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,735
Krieg's world burned itself to ash... and its soldiers STILL die for the Emperor.

2
00:00:07,385 --> 00:00:10,175
Why?! Did he save them?

3
00:00:10,825 --> 00:00:16,106
No. They rebelled against him five hundred years ago. And lost.

4
00:00:16,656 --> 00:00:18,384
Then why fight for him now?

5
00:00:19,084 --> 00:00:25,819
Penance. Every Kriegsman owes a debt, and pays it by dying in battle.

6
00:00:26,469 --> 00:00:28,358
They WANT to die?!

7
00:00:29,258 --> 00:00:36,712
Imagine an army that fears nothing. Not death. Not you. Not me.

8
00:00:37,262 --> 00:00:40,332
And the Emperor just... accepts that?

9
00:00:40,982 --> 00:00:43,181
He accepts everything, kid.

10
00:00:43,981 --> 00:00:46,353
...So what do I owe him?

11
00:00:46,903 --> 00:00:50,470
Everything, Private. Krieg just keeps the receipt.

12
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:54,252
...Sarge? Why does he still fight for the Emperor?

